el appears weightless, designed with levitating magnetic elements or an intricate lattice structure resembling nanotechnology.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Neon-blue and holographic accents flow along the contours of the shoe, subtly glowing as if powered by an internal energy source. The silhouette is aerodynamic and bold, with seamless edges and an ergonomic, gravity-defying arch.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The background is a minimalist high-tech studio, with soft, diffused lighting reflecting off the glossy surface of the shoe. Subtle light streaks and a futuristic city skyline in the distance add depth, reinforcing the ultra-modern aesthetic.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Style: 8K ultra-HD, hyper-realistic, high-tech futurism, cybernetic luxury, sleek industrial elegance, cinematic lighting, commercial fashion photography</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">A breathtaking high-heel shoe inspired by the opulence of the Baroque era, crafted from rich velvet and adorned with intricate gold filigree. The surface is decorated with delicate floral engravings, swirling rococo patterns, and encrusted gemstones—sapphires, rubies, or emeralds—set into the golden framework.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The sculpted heel is a true masterpiece, resembling the elegant columns of a royal palace, with miniature cherubs or ornate carvings wrapped around its structure. The shoe’s pointed toe is finished with a luxurious gold embellishment, while the inside is lined with deep crimson silk, providing the ultimate comfort and grandeur.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The background is a lavish palace interior, with soft candlelight reflecting off gilded mirrors, velvet drapes, and towering chandeliers. A subtle glow enhances the shoe’s regal elegance, making it look like a treasure fit for a queen.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Style: 8K ultra-HD, hyper-realistic, Baroque luxury, gold filigree, royal elegance, cinematic lighting, commercial high-fashion photography</span></li></ol><p><br></p><h2><strong style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Практическое задание:</strong></h2><ol><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Сгенерируйте изображение с помощью функции Image Creation, используя ваш промт. Или использую промт: кот с пушистой шерстью и внимательным взглядом сидит на бревне в лесу. Вокруг него тихая природа, мягкий свет заката пробивается сквозь листву деревьев, окрашивая сцену в тёплые пастельные оттенки. Кот спокойно наблюдает за окружающим миром, создавая атмосферу уюта и гармонии.</span></li></ol><p><em style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">*Леонардо поддерживает русских язык, но я советую переводить все на английский.</em></p><ol><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Примените функцию Upscaler, чтобы увеличить разрешение созданного изображения.</span></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-u