изображение</p><p>Нажмите кнопку "Download":</p><p>- Бесплатно доступно скачивание изображения в стандартном качестве.</p><p>- Для скачивания в полном размере потребуется регистрация и покупка платного тарифа.</p><p><br></p><p>Преимущества Remove.bg:</p><p>- Быстрая обработка (несколько секунд).</p><p>- Качественное удаление фона даже у сложных объектов (волосы, мелкие детали).</p><p>- Можно использовать бесплатно без регистрации для базовых задач.</p><h2><br></h2>			"['les_6_1.jpg', 'les_6_2.jpg', 'les_6_3.jpg']"	Image Generation in the Free Version of Leonardo AI. Background Removal in REMOVE.bg	<h2><strong>Lesson Objective:</strong></h2><p> This lesson will introduce you to the Leonardo AI platform and its key features for image generation. You will learn how to create unique images based on text descriptions, edit results, and enhance quality using the Upscaler feature.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>Lesson content:</strong></h2><ol><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Introduction to the Leonardo AI platform</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Using the Image Creation feature</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Enhancing images with Upscaler</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Transforming images with Image-to-Image</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Conclusion</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Practical assignment</li></ol><p><br></p>	https://kinescope.io/3URrKyiSA2vagc72Ti5VYV	Leonardo AI	<p><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Website: </span><a href="https://app.leonardo.ai/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">https://app.leonardo.ai/</a></p>	<h2><strong>1. Leonardo AI Platform</strong></h2><p>Leonardo AI is a tool that allows users to create unique images based on text descriptions. With its simple interface and powerful algorithms, even beginners can easily master image generation. The platform offers a wide range of styles and settings to create images that match your ideas and requirements.</p><h2><strong>2. Image Creation Feature</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Image Creation</strong> feature enables users to generate images based on text prompts. Here are the main steps:</p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Entering a Prompt</strong>: Describe what you want to see in the image.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> Example:</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>"A fluffy cat with an attentive gaze sits on a log in the forest. The peaceful nature around it is illuminated by the soft light of the sunset filtering through the tree leaves, painting the scene in warm pastel tones. The cat calmly observes the surroundings, creating an atmosphere of coziness and harmony."</em></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Choosing a Style</strong>: The platform offers various styles (realistic, cartoonish, futuristic, etc.) that can be applied to the generation process.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Adjusting Parameters</strong>: Customize the color palette, level of detail, light intensity, and other parameters.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Generating the Image</strong>: Click <strong>"Create"</strong> to start the process.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Editing the Result</strong>: If the result does not fully match your expectations, tweak the settings or refine the prompt and generate again.</li></ol><h2><strong>3. Upscaler Feature</strong></h2><p>The <strong>Upscaler</strong> is used to increase the resolution of images without losing quality. This is especially useful for printing or displaying images on larger screens.</p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Uploading an Image</strong>: Select the generated image and upload it to <strong>Upscaler</strong>.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Choosing the Upscale Level</strong>: Select the scale (2x, 4x, or higher). The free version supports only <strong>4x</strong>.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Processing the Image</strong>: Start the enhancement process. The <strong>Upscaler</strong> will improve sharpness and detail.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Saving the Enhanced Image</strong>: Download the final result and compare it with the original.</li></ol><h2><strong>4. Image-to-Image Feature</strong></h2><p>Leonardo AI also offers an interesting <strong>Image-to-Image</strong> feature:</p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Open <strong>Leonardo AI</strong> and go to <strong>Image Creation</strong>.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>In the upper left corner, find the <strong>photo icon</strong>, click on it, and select <strong>Image-to-Image</strong>.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Upload your reference image and enter a prompt specifying the style you want to apply.</li></ol><p>Below are some example prompts used to change the style of an image:</p><ol><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Nature-Inspired Avant-Garde High-Heel Shoe</strong></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>A breathtaking avant-garde women's high-heel shoe inspired by nature, covered in lush, vibrant moss and delicate blooming flowers. The sculpted, asymmetrical heel is made of intertwining vines and roots, giving it an organic, fairytale-like aesthetic. The shoe's surface is a fusion of smooth, polished wood and soft, velvety moss, with dewdrops shimmering under the sunlight. Tiny bioluminescent mushrooms sprout from the edges, adding a touch of magical realism.</em></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>The background is a dreamy, misty forest with soft natural light filtering through the leaves. A gentle glow highlights the shoe’s intricate textures, emphasizing its blend of nature and high fashion. The composition is designed in a luxury editorial photography style, creating a hyper-realistic 8K image with cinematic lighting, soft shadows, and an ethereal atmosphere.</em></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Futuristic High-Heel Shoe</strong></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>A cutting-edge high-heel shoe with a sleek, futuristic design, crafted from advanced materials. The surface is a fusion of ultra-polished liquid metal and transparent graphene-infused panels, creating a dynamic interplay of light and reflections. The sculpted heel appears weightless, designed with levitating magnetic elements or an intricate lattice structure resembling nanotechnology.</em></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>Neon-blue and holographic accents flow along the contours of the shoe, subtly glowing as if powered by an internal energy source. The silhouette is aerodynamic and bold, with seamless edges and an ergonomic, gravity-defying arch.</em></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>The background is a minimalist high-tech studio, with soft, diffused lighting reflecting off the glossy surface of the shoe. Subtle light streaks and a futuristic city skyline in the distance add depth, reinforcing the ultra-modern aesthetic.</em></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><strong>Baroque-Inspired High-Heel Shoe</strong></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>A breathtaking high-heel shoe inspired by the opulence of the Baroque era, crafted from rich velvet and adorned with intricate gold filigree. The surface is decorated with delicate floral engravings, swirling rococo patterns, and encrusted gemstones—sapphires, rubies, or emeralds—set into the golden framework.</em></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>The sculpted heel is a true masterpiece, resembling the elegant columns of a royal palace, with miniature cherubs or ornate carvings wrapped around its structure. The shoe’s pointed toe is finished with a luxurious gold embellishment, while the inside is lined with deep crimson silk, providing the ultimate comfort and grandeur.</em></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>The background is a lavish palace interior, with soft candlelight reflecting off gilded mirrors, velvet drapes, and towering chandeliers. A subtle glow enhances the shoe’s regal elegance, making it look like a treasure fit for a queen.</em></li></ol><p><br></p><h2><strong>Practical Assignment:</strong></h2><ol><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Generate an image using the <strong>Image Creation</strong> feature with your own prompt. Alternatively, you can use this prompt:</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>"A fluffy cat with an attentive gaze sits on a log in the forest. The peaceful nature around it is illuminated by the soft light of the sunset filtering through the tree leaves, painting the scene in warm pastel tones. The cat calmly observes the surroundings, creating an atmosphere of coziness and harmony."</em></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> <em>(Leonardo AI supports the Russian language, but I recommend translating everything into English for better results.)</em></li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Apply the <strong>Upscaler</strong> feature to increase the resolution of the generated image.</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Save both results and analyze how the quality improved after using the <strong>Upscaler</strong>.</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Attach your completed assignment to the lesson.</li></ol><p><br></p><h2><strong>Conclusion:</strong></h2><p>Now you are familiar with the core features of <strong>Leonardo AI</strong> and can create unique images. The <strong>Image Creation</strong> feature allows you to bring any visual idea to life, while the <strong>Upscaler</strong> enhances quality, making images suitable for various projects. Practical application of image generation and enhancement opens up opportunities for creative work and professional tasks.</p><p><strong>Keep experimenting and improving your skills!</strong></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>Guide to Using Remove.bg</strong></h2><h2><br></h2><h4><strong>1. Go to the Website</strong></h4><p>Visit the official website:</p><p> [<a href="https://www.remove.bg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.remove.bg</a>]</p><h4><strong>2. Upload an Image</strong></h4><p>Click the <strong>"Upload Image"</strong> button.</p><p> Select a photo from your computer or drag and drop an image directly into the browser window.</p><h4><strong>3. Automatic Background Removal</strong></h4><p>After uploading, the site will automatically remove the background from your image.</p><p> On the left, you will see the original image, and on the right—the image with a transparent background.</p><h4><strong>4. Additional Editing (Optional)</strong></h4><p>Click the <strong>"Edit"</strong> button:</p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>You can manually adjust the edges using the <strong>Erase/Restore</strong> tools.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>You can also add a new background: choose a solid color or upload your own image.</li></ol><h4><strong>5. Save the Image</strong></h4><p>Click the <strong>"Download"</strong> button:</p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Free downloads are available in standard quality.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>To download in full resolution, registration and a paid plan are required.</li></ol><p><br></p><h3><strong>Benefits of Remove.bg:</strong></h3><p>✔ Fast processing (a few seconds).</p><p> ✔ High-quality background removal, even for complex objects (hair, fine details).</p><p> ✔ Free to use without registration for basic tasks.</p>	\N	\N	\N
