31	2025-03-03 13:52:49.578082+00	2	5d71aa84-29fc-4433-a67d-3be80d1935bf	https://fhrxyovnqcwqtyxzcdvr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/homeworks/1741009967170-Designer%20(6).jpeg	### Full Breakdown with Timing  \n\n### Scene 1: Ski Lift and Drinking (0-5 seconds)  \n⏳ Time Duration: 0-5 seconds  \n\nPrompt for Image:  \n"A skier wearing a red ski suit, black gloves, and a helmet sits on a ski lift high above a snowy mountain landscape. The background features snow-covered peaks and evergreen trees under a bright blue sky. He is holding a small metal flask in one hand, taking a sip, with a relaxed posture. His goggles reflect the white slopes below, and his cheeks are slightly flushed from the cold."  \n\nPrompt for Animation:  \n"The ski lift gently sways as the skier takes a sip from his flask. He leans back slightly, enjoying the drink, and exhales a visible breath in the cold air. Snow-capped mountains pass by in the background as the lift moves up the slope."  \n\n---\n\n### Scene 2: Skiing Down the Slope (5-10 seconds)  \n⏳ Time Duration: 5-10 seconds  \n\nPrompt for Image:  \n"A skier in a red ski suit is speeding down a snowy slope, leaving a trail of powder behind him. His posture is slightly unsteady, and his facial expression shows a growing, goofy smile. His goggles are slightly askew, and his arms flail slightly as he tries to maintain balance. The bright sun shines overhead, casting long shadows on the smooth, untouched snow."  \n\nPrompt for Animation:  \n"The skier carves through the snow, but his movements become wobbly. His skis slide unevenly, and he starts to sway slightly from side to side. His smile gets bigger as he loses focus, and his arms flail as he struggles to stay upright."  \n\n---\n\n### Scene 3: Collision with a Tree (10-15 seconds)  \n⏳ Time Duration: 10-15 seconds  \n\nPrompt for Image:  \n"A skier in a red ski suit is just moments away from crashing into a thick pine tree. His body is tilted forward, arms outstretched in panic. His goggles are now completely askew, and his expression is a mix of shock and helplessness. Snow is flying up from his skis as he tries to stop, but it's too late. The towering pine tree stands firmly in the middle of the slope, its bark rough and covered in patches of snow."  \n\nPrompt for Animation:  \n"The skier wobbles uncontrollably, his arms flailing as he loses complete control. He tries to stop, but his skis cross, and he tumbles forward. The motion speeds up as he slides directly toward the tree, his body spinning slightly before colliding with a loud thud. Snow bursts into the air upon impact, and his helmet bounces slightly from the shock."  \n\n---  \nСМОГЛА ЗАГРУЗИТЬ ТОЛЬКО ОДНО ФОТО	\N	\N	\N	f
